accept (required string)
: Specifies the requested format (MIME type) of the audio. Use / to request the default audio format, audio/ogg;codecs=opus. For more information, see [Using audio formats](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/text-to-speech?topic=text-to-speech-audio-formats).

